Package: send-to-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, xdg-user-dirs, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: dolphin | nemo
Description: Create desktop shortcuts from file manager context menus
 Adds a Send to Desktop action to KDE Dolphin and Cinnamon's Nemo file
 managers. Creates desktop launchers for selected local files and folders
 without moving the original items.
